2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"BILI 2018 Q3","e":"bili","d":"2018-11-20","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Marcus Yang","x":"We understand that [inaudible] streaming platforms have been banned for a while.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/21/bilibili-inc-bili-q3-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"BILI 2018 Q4","e":"bili","d":"2019-02-27","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Xin Fan","x":"Today, our submission progress has been more streamlined with technical updates, our mobile content submission and streaming.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/28/bilibili-inc-bili-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"BILI 2018 Q4","e":"bili","d":"2019-02-27","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Xin Fan","x":"We recorded peak live streaming page views during the LPL S8 final game, which reached the top industry levels.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/28/bilibili-inc-bili-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"BILI 2019 Q3","e":"bili","d":"2019-11-19","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Alex Poon","x":"And my second question is related to live streaming.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/19/bilibili-inc-bili-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BILI 2020 Q1","e":"bili","d":"2020-05-19","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Lei Zhang","x":"We have seen strong revenue growth in fourth quarter of non-game, especially less and we also noticed some positive business development recently in music and live streaming.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/19/bilibili-inc-bili-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BILI 2020 Q1","e":"bili","d":"2020-05-19","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Lei Zhang","x":"Could management share more color on the efforts we have made in non-game business, especially our policy with live streaming?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/19/bilibili-inc-bili-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BILI 2020 Q2","e":"bili","d":"2020-08-27","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Alex Liu","x":"Just wondering what are the major difference in terms of operating know-how and the roadmap between live streaming business and all the core business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/27/bilibili-inc-bili-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BILI 2020 Q2","e":"bili","d":"2020-08-27","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Alex Liu","x":"Should we consider live streaming as a business that requires some time of incubations and will reach an inflection point on user adoptions?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/27/bilibili-inc-bili-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BILI 2020 Q3","e":"bili","d":"2020-11-19","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Binnie Wong","x":"Very impressive to see on amortization, advertising, live streaming or continue triple digit growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/19/bilibili-inc-bili-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BILI 2020 Q3","e":"bili","d":"2020-11-19","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Binnie Wong","x":"And especially as we see some of your short video and live streaming players are also very aggressive in growing the advertising business in particular.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/19/bilibili-inc-bili-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BILI 2021 Q1","e":"bili","d":"2021-05-13","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rui Chen","x":"And for that, we'll continue to invest in R&D, in our algorithm to improve our AI-powered recommendation system. [Foreign Speech] So, these above-mentioned points will be our constant areas for improvement.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/13/bilibili-inc-bili-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BILI 2021 Q2","e":"bili","d":"2021-08-19","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Xin Fan","x":"For ACG and entertainment enthusiasts, our content continue to expand with our huge anime library and unique live broadcasting entertainment, particularly virtual streamer of VR content.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/19/bilibili-inc-bili-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BILI 2021 Q2","e":"bili","d":"2021-08-19","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Alex Yao","x":"[Foreign Speech] So my question is about the regulatory impact on streaming and the live streaming operation given the changing regulatory environment in this space and the potentially more policy coming out in the next couple of quarters.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/19/bilibili-inc-bili-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BILI 2021 Q3","e":"bili","d":"2021-11-17","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Brian Gong","x":"Our ecosystem, our streaming video large screening, and actually, we already have our virtual community.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/17/bilibili-inc-bili-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BILI 2021 Q3","e":"bili","d":"2021-11-17","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Lei Zhang","x":"My question is mainly regarding live-streaming business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/17/bilibili-inc-bili-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BILI 2025 Q1","e":"bili","d":"2025-05-20","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Rui Chen","x":"About 1.5 million creators made money on Bilibili during the quarter, not just through ads or live streaming, but also by using our e-commerce tools and various fan support programs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/05/20/bilibili-bili-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BILI 2025 Q1","e":"bili","d":"2025-05-20","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Rui Chen","x":"For example, we did a joint marketing campaign with Sunmo, with the leading game streamers PDD and YMD, and the campaign was quite successful and helped us to attract a lot of new users and awaken a lot of the dormant users.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/05/20/bilibili-bili-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BILI 2025 Q1","e":"bili","d":"2025-05-20","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rui Chen","x":"We have continued to up marketing data infrastructure by using the multimodal AI ability to better understand our users' purchase intent and on category level interest, boosting our overall ad efficiency.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/05/20/bilibili-bili-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BILI 2025 Q1","e":"bili","d":"2025-05-20","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rui Chen","x":"And that's why we are seeing a big surge in AI-related advertising spending, and also this helps us to drive the overall online services sector to become the top two ad vertical.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/05/20/bilibili-bili-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BILI 2025 Q2","e":"bili","d":"2025-08-21","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Rui Chen","x":"And its box office has exceeded 1 billion RMB.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/22/bilibili-bili-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BILI 2025 Q2","e":"bili","d":"2025-08-21","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Rui Chen","x":"We continue to leverage our high-quality full-chain conversion capability, we further strengthened our market share in premium game advertising while expanding to new scenarios such as Bilibili Inc. mini-games and game live streaming, creating incremental revenue opportunities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/22/bilibili-bili-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BILI 2025 Q2","e":"bili","d":"2025-08-21","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Rui Chen","x":"One is a broader application and linkage of products and technologies across multiple endpoints and scenarios, including but not limited to PC, OTT, store mode, live streaming, search, and trending topics.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/22/bilibili-bili-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BILI 2025 Q3","e":"bili","d":"2025-11-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rui Chen","x":"We further enhanced the user experience by streamlining gameplay and character progression to create a more balanced and enduring title.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/13/bilibili-bili-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BILI 2026 Q2","e":"bili","d":"2026-08-27","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rui Chen","x":"That is why we remain committed to our AI strategy while staying highly disciplined in how we invest.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/31/bilibili-bili-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BILI 2026 Q2","e":"bili","d":"2026-08-27","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Xin Fan","x":"G&A expenses were flat and R&D expenses increased by 16%, primarily due to continued investment in our AI capabilities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/31/bilibili-bili-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[34,1,3994,0,0,0,3623,105],[35,1,5200,0,0,0,4541,282],[36,1,6159,0,0,0,5391,451],[39,1,5640,0,0,0,4950,324],[40,1,6455,0,0,0,5813,385],[41,1,5929,0,0,0,5309,348],[42,1,5686,0,0,0,5205,236],[43,1,6127,0,0,0,5334,473],[44,1,5163,0,0,0,4760,185],[45,1,5368,0,0,0,4899,221],[46,1,6186,0,0,0,5677,254],[47,1,6173,0,0,0,5786,174],[61,1,5431,0,0,0,4886,209],[62,1,5989,1,1,0,5323,350],[63,1,6521,0,0,0,5827,385],[66,1,6229,0,0,0,2564,3251]],"cinema":[[34,1,3994,0,0,0,3623,105],[35,1,5200,0,0,0,4541,282],[36,1,6159,0,0,0,5391,451],[39,1,5640,0,0,0,4950,324],[40,1,6455,0,0,0,5813,385],[41,1,5929,0,0,0,5309,348],[42,1,5686,0,0,0,5205,236],[43,1,6127,0,0,0,5334,473],[44,1,5163,0,0,0,4760,185],[45,1,5368,0,0,0,4899,221],[46,1,6186,0,0,0,5677,254],[47,1,6173,0,0,0,5